{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"text":"Colored Surface","anchor":"Colored-Surface","type":"heading","level":3},{"tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Orange"}]}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Wireframe"}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Colored backgrounds use surface colors to maximize the contrast with content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The colors of several OUDS components (for instance "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") are automatically adjusted if they are placed on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do so, some tokens associated with these specific colors can be customized and are identified with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Mono","type":"text"}]},{"text":" suffix (for instance ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"colorBgDefaultEnabledMono"}]},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"text":"How it works","anchor":"How-it-works","type":"heading","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"According to the color, the "},{"code":"OUDSColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" component adds in SwiftUI environment two flags:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"oudsUseMonochrome","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": to inform a component that needs to use mono version of tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"oudsOnColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": to inform a component it is placed on colored surface even if the mono is off"}]}]}]},{"level":4,"anchor":"How-to-use","type":"heading","text":"How to use"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ The folowing view has a colored background \"onStatusPositiveEmphasized\" with","    \/\/ - a text with the color adapted according to the adjusted colorScheme      ","    \/\/ - a button that uses the mono version of tokens","","    \/\/ As view","    OUDSColoredSurface(color: theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized) {","        VStack {","            Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","            .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","            OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","        }","    }","","    \/\/ As view modifier","","    VStack {","        Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","        .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","        OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","    }","    .coloredSurface(theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized)"]},{"anchor":"Debuging-contrast-ratios","type":"heading","text":"Debuging contrast ratios","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/"},{"type":"text","text":", also named “RGAA”."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However it is highly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for texts and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some components like "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be used on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ; thus in that case we can know the surface color for a given component on it, and compute the contrast ratio, and in the end display or not warnings."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To do that, some steps must be followed in your component implementation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rise the flag to allow debugging (e.g. i #DEBUG mode)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Get the environment variable defined by the colored surface containing the applied color","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In the component implementation, add a line of code comparing the color to test and that surface","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then keep an eye on your logs ; warnings will be added there if WCAG 2.1 3:1, 4.5:1 or 7:1 ratios are not reached, depending to the methods you call"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Rise the flag","#if DEBUG","OUDSWCAG21Ratios.oudsDebugWCAG21Colors = true","#endif","","\/\/ Supposing we are in your component View \/ ViewModifer struct","","\/\/ Get the applied surface color","@Environment(\\.oudsSurfaceColor) var surfaceColor","","\/\/ In the function defining the color to apply, add the line below","\/\/ where colorTokenToApply is the color to apply from a theme:","","\/\/ Non-textual components, in AA","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .nonTextual)","","\/\/ Textual components and AAA to check","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .AAA)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Divider","level":3,"text":"Divider","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"How-it-works","level":4,"type":"heading","text":"How it works"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A divider is used to separate content elements in a view. Two kinds of divider are proposed:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider"},{"text":": to separate elements stacked vertically (e.g. in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSVerticalDivider"},{"text":": to separate elements stacked horizontally (e.g. in `HStack)","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A divider can be colored using color enumerated in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSDividerColor"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Horizontal","type":"heading","level":5,"text":"Horizontal"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Orange","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh","type":"image"}]}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe"}]}],"title":"Wireframe"}]},{"text":"Vertical","level":5,"anchor":"Vertical","type":"heading"},{"tabs":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Sosh"}]}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe"}]}],"title":"Wireframe"}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"text":"How to use","level":4,"anchor":"How-to-use","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Add a vertical divider between items","HStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSVerticalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}","","\/\/ Add an horizontal divider between items","VStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Layouts","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLa